 ## Money
 
-Prices are typed in euros (`12.99`, `1,299.00`) and kept in whole cents. The monthly cost of a yearly plan is its
-price divided by 12.
+Prices are typed in euros (`12.99`, `1,299.00`) and kept in whole cents. Monthly costs are calculated and cut to the nearest cent:
+- Monthly plans: price per month
+- Yearly plans: price ÷ 12 months
+- Weekly plans: (price × 52 weeks) ÷ 12 months
 
